{"type":"seed","doc_id":"d3_react_managing-state","fact_refs":[6],"question":"What does 'lifting state up' mean according to the Managing State doc?","answer":"It means removing state from two components, moving it to their closest common parent, and passing it down to both via props, so the state can change together."}
